Raytracer
=========

Start:

npm install
npm start          # dev server na http://localhost:8004 (port lze zmenit pres PORT)
npm run build      # produkcni build do dist/
npm run watch      # vyvojovy build do dist/ se sledovanim zmen
npm run typecheck  # kontrola typu (TypeScript), build ji spousti automaticky

Render bezi ve Web Workerech (?threads=N meni jejich pocet, vychozi min(jader, 8),
?phong=0 zapne pruhledny material). Scenu (model a BVH) postavi jednou prvni worker.
Scena i pozadi (cubemapa) se mezi workery sdili pres SharedArrayBuffer,
coz vyzaduje cross-origin isolation - server musi posilat hlavicky

Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

Dev server je posila sam, pri nasazeni dist/ je treba je nastavit na serveru.
Bez nich render funguje taky, jen se cubemapa (~96 MB) a scena (~12 MB) kopiruji do kazdeho workeru.

Workflow:

- load ply
- build geometry
- build BVH tree from geometry
- render final image using BVH tree

